[{"client_msg_id":"b4471c69-097c-438a-b048-846ee7ea9f5d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ランニングの場合、お腹いっぱいの直後はなかなか厳しいので夕食後ちょっと時間あけて走る様にしてるけど、時間の都合もありときおり夕食前だったり夕食直後だったり。","ts":"1622471425.376700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=BYDF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78b29960-d037-4e68-bc45-57a3754c5f70","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"御飯食べるタイミング調整せねば","ts":"1622470791.375400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RV8UM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7eab5b54-7ecd-4ca6-9da2-920d4f23d0bc","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"たしか、タンパク質が分解してエネルギーにしようとするらしい","ts":"1622470781.375000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6pK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fc7eef1-c375-4a82-94ee-d16de5d6d685","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ですね","ts":"1622470730.374000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mxt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82252281-2525-4c52-aa2e-ce94abd6815f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"空腹状態で運動すると筋肉が消費されるからやめた方がいいってリングフィットに言われた","ts":"1622470242.373800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xUH9N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3D18F4B0-351E-44D7-82C0-2ABB4062CABA","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"今度からもう少し時間ちゃんと考えねば","ts":"1622468099.373200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G18K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B2486E7A-C1CD-4FA1-B09A-B3A2BEBFB0A7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"遅めにご飯食べたけど、残業でお腹すいてしまった","ts":"1622468084.372600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vikzT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D2661752-B752-4BE8-8780-547392C179DE","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ジム行ってきたけど、お腹すいてる状態だとやっぱりあんまり力でないすね","ts":"1622468063.371900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dl4f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e2c9d1d-85d0-4e13-876e-bb7c7cb3ecac","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"30分以内がいいとおもってた","ts":"1622431251.371100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gx4Lj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e9eeeac-b27c-4625-bdc3-834f1471c4e0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"運動後、30分経ったらプロテイン飲むと良いらしい","ts":"1622430155.370900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n2hV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91ed1a83-8157-4b2a-af5a-4780c71fc55c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"サーバ運んだので全身筋肉痛になってます","ts":"1622425712.370600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7aM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed145543-8f7b-45a9-904e-39e3539d60f6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"プロテインってそういう効果あるのか。","ts":"1622424941.370300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jj4s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86b0b678-c147-49a8-a71c-427f36050b62","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/hiroyukim/status/1399177317792968704\u003e","ts":"1622424932.369800","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/hiroyukim|@hiroyukim\u003e: プロテイン飲むとトレーニング後のだるい症状がダイブ緩和されるというのが自分の認識かなぁ。最初は体作りのために飲んでたんですが。\n\nプロテイン＋整理運動（重要）で運動後のだるさがかなり緩和されます。","id":1,"author_name":"hiroyukim","author_subname":"@hiroyukim","author_link":"https://twitter.com/hiroyukim/status/1399177317792968704","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/94649304/neko_normal.jpg","text":"プロテイン飲むとトレーニング後のだるい症状がダイブ緩和されるというのが自分の認識かなぁ。最初は体作りのために飲んでたんですが。\n\nプロテイン＋整理運動（重要）で運動後のだるさがかなり緩和されます。","blocks":null,"footer":"